WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.100 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 8=

01:47.940 --> 01:51.020
(Be proactive and responsible.
Strive to be the best.)

01:56.930 --> 01:57.810
Reporting, Ms. Xu.

01:58.560 --> 02:01.500
I've decided to marry
Comrade Fang Muyang.

02:02.060 --> 02:04.140
I'd like you to issue us
a letter of introduction

02:04.226 --> 02:05.530
for the marriage registration.

02:11.600 --> 02:13.060
You and Fang Muyang?

02:13.130 --> 02:15.090
Ms. Xu, please don't misunderstand.

02:15.880 --> 02:17.300
Up until yesterday,

02:17.460 --> 02:18.840
Comrade Fang Muyang and I

02:18.840 --> 02:21.040
were purely comrades.

02:21.830 --> 02:23.670
Comrade Ye Feng
made me realize I shouldn't

02:24.300 --> 02:25.340
aim above my station.

02:25.640 --> 02:26.690
It was he

02:26.690 --> 02:28.500
who helped me see my place.

02:28.500 --> 02:29.530
He helped me understand

02:29.770 --> 02:32.460
that Comrade Fang Muyang is
the one best suited to me.

02:35.990 --> 02:38.850
Fei, that's not quite right.

02:40.130 --> 02:41.410
In this new society,

02:41.448 --> 02:43.515
we don't talk about matching
family backgrounds.

02:43.620 --> 02:44.940
And there's no such thing

02:45.880 --> 02:48.190
as reaching above your station.

02:49.920 --> 02:51.200
You young people,

02:51.200 --> 02:52.180
when it comes to love,

02:52.180 --> 02:53.130
you lack experience.

02:53.940 --> 02:55.250
If you take a wrong turn,

02:55.300 --> 02:56.740
as long as you correct it in time,

02:56.810 --> 02:57.870
you're still good comrades.

02:58.500 --> 02:59.420
In any case,

02:59.520 --> 03:00.920
I hope you and Ye Feng

03:01.460 --> 03:02.740
remain good colleagues

03:03.280 --> 03:04.030
and good comrades.

03:04.940 --> 03:05.850
I understand.

03:06.080 --> 03:09.060
Ms. Xu,
about that letter of introduction…

03:12.500 --> 03:13.826
Have you thought this through?

03:15.090 --> 03:16.020
I have.

03:18.240 --> 03:18.800
All right.

03:19.530 --> 03:20.460
I'll issue it for you.

03:20.460 --> 03:22.020
(Jiangcheng Worker-Peasant Hospital)

03:35.020 --> 03:37.250
We agreed to meet here. Where did he go?

03:37.860 --> 03:38.690
Zhou.

03:39.240 --> 03:40.130
Where's Fang Muyang?

03:40.580 --> 03:41.850
He went out early this morning.

03:41.850 --> 03:42.810
He hasn't come back.

03:48.020 --> 03:49.182
(China Famous Tea, Biluochun)

03:49.182 --> 03:50.293
Come, have some tea.

03:50.537 --> 03:51.340
Thank you, Mrs. Fei.

03:51.537 --> 03:53.248
Fang, why are you being so polite?

03:53.271 --> 03:54.410
It's enough that you came.

03:54.410 --> 03:55.850
And you even brought such fine tea.

03:56.226 --> 03:57.030
Don't mention it.

03:58.090 --> 03:59.940
What, have you never
seen tea before?

04:02.940 --> 04:05.500
Don't you think
this tea looks a bit familiar?

04:05.560 --> 04:07.737
Is there anything
that doesn't look familiar to you?

04:09.090 --> 04:10.060
Please don't mind us.

04:10.060 --> 04:11.500
You have a wonderful relationship.

04:11.740 --> 04:12.940
I noticed it last time.

04:13.530 --> 04:14.630
It's truly enviable.

04:15.780 --> 04:17.540
You really know how to talk.

04:18.340 --> 04:19.960
Are you fully recovered now?

04:20.130 --> 04:20.870
I'm fine.

04:22.980 --> 04:24.590
Such a good lad.

04:25.500 --> 04:26.690
Too bad you were injured.

04:27.010 --> 04:28.000
Poor thing.

04:30.960 --> 04:31.740
Fang,

04:31.740 --> 04:34.100
you really don't need to bring
so many things next time.

04:34.410 --> 04:34.940
Well,

04:35.340 --> 04:37.920
I know you're
very grateful to Fei Ni.

04:38.660 --> 04:39.690
But Fei Ni

04:39.740 --> 04:40.740
is getting married.

04:41.330 --> 04:42.130
I know.

04:43.450 --> 04:44.330
Mr. Fei, Mrs. Fei.

04:44.860 --> 04:46.330
I came today to formally propose.

04:46.810 --> 04:48.100
I'm going to marry Fei Ni.

04:48.690 --> 04:49.620
What did you say?

04:52.770 --> 04:53.660
Say that again.

04:54.060 --> 04:55.500
I'm going to marry Fei Ni.

05:03.540 --> 05:05.020
Dad. Mom.

05:06.420 --> 05:06.990
Fei Ni.

05:08.210 --> 05:08.900
You're back.

05:17.230 --> 05:17.890
Fang Muyang.

05:18.690 --> 05:19.730
Didn't I tell you

05:19.730 --> 05:21.130
I wouldn't go to the hospital again?

05:21.226 --> 05:22.350
There's no point coming here.

05:22.500 --> 05:24.880
Get up. Let's go. Out.

05:24.880 --> 05:26.330
Alright, alright. Stop pretending.

05:26.840 --> 05:28.010
Fang Muyang already told us.

05:29.220 --> 05:29.890
Told you what?

05:30.660 --> 05:31.210
Turn around.

05:32.270 --> 05:33.540
Fei Ni, what's going on?

05:33.860 --> 05:35.690
Fang Muyang said
you're going to marry him.

05:36.020 --> 05:38.370
He even brought all these gifts.

05:39.330 --> 05:41.290
Didn't you say you wouldn't tell anyone?

05:41.290 --> 05:42.690
- How could you tell them?
- You...

05:45.060 --> 05:45.580
Come with me.

05:50.040 --> 05:51.970
You, step outside.

05:57.210 --> 05:58.130
Start talking.

05:58.820 --> 05:59.890
What's this about?

06:00.010 --> 06:01.890
Are you really going to marry that fool?

06:02.420 --> 06:04.010
Mom, Fang Muyang isn't a fool.

06:04.640 --> 06:05.660
Don't argue with me.

06:06.620 --> 06:08.100
Didn't you tell me yourself

06:08.100 --> 06:10.130
that there was nothing
going on between you two?

06:10.210 --> 06:10.737
That was...

06:10.960 --> 06:11.860
Not before.

06:12.620 --> 06:13.430
There is now.

06:13.660 --> 06:14.100
You...

06:16.180 --> 06:18.970
Ni, have you completely
lost your mind?

06:19.240 --> 06:21.330
Weren't you seeing Ye Feng?

06:22.000 --> 06:23.130
We broke up.

06:24.660 --> 06:25.370
You broke up?

06:27.982 --> 06:29.100
Forget whose fault it was.

06:30.040 --> 06:31.380
You end things with Ye Feng

06:31.690 --> 06:33.620
and the next minute
you're marrying Fang Muyang?

06:33.620 --> 06:34.200
How...

06:34.770 --> 06:36.860
How is that not two-timing?

06:37.100 --> 06:38.330
If people find out,

06:38.330 --> 06:39.940
the gossip alone will bury you.

06:40.080 --> 06:41.860
Let them talk.

06:42.020 --> 06:43.500
I love Fang Muyang.

06:43.500 --> 06:44.500
I'm marrying him.

06:45.130 --> 06:47.530
You want to marry her? Not a chance.

06:49.690 --> 06:51.620
Fang Muyang,
what on earth are you thinking?

06:51.620 --> 06:52.540
Look at you.

06:52.860 --> 06:54.330
You don't even have a proper job.

06:54.330 --> 06:56.130
And forget about
having a place of your own.

06:56.130 --> 06:57.710
You can barely feed yourself,

06:57.710 --> 06:58.860
and you want to get married?

06:59.420 --> 07:00.990
How are you going to support Ni?

07:01.620 --> 07:02.100
Sir,

07:02.930 --> 07:04.330
my sister left me one hundred yuan.

07:04.382 --> 07:06.340
I'm in a training course
at the Jiangcheng Daily.

07:06.420 --> 07:08.360
I'll be able to earn money
drawing comic strips.

07:09.248 --> 07:10.100
I can support Fei Ni.

07:10.100 --> 07:10.770
Alright, alright.

07:10.970 --> 07:11.860
Forget marriage.

07:12.140 --> 07:13.300
You shouldn't even like her.

07:14.240 --> 07:15.540
What do you even see in him?

07:16.810 --> 07:18.640
So he's decent-looking,

07:18.740 --> 07:19.810
and has a mild temper.

07:19.910 --> 07:20.890
What good is that?

07:21.330 --> 07:22.330
When you marry a man,

07:22.330 --> 07:23.315
it's about livelihood.

07:23.360 --> 07:25.440
He doesn't even have a stable job.

07:25.440 --> 07:26.810
And with his condition,

07:27.280 --> 07:28.740
what if he never fully recovers?

07:29.330 --> 07:30.250
What then?

07:30.300 --> 07:32.130
What if he relapses one day?

07:32.500 --> 07:34.130
By then, it'll be too late for regrets.

07:35.350 --> 07:37.010
We'll deal with it
when we get there.

07:37.660 --> 07:38.450
Ni,

07:39.250 --> 07:40.010
you've always been

07:40.460 --> 07:42.860
so sensible
and careful since you were little.

07:43.330 --> 07:45.010
But when it comes to your own marriage,

07:45.010 --> 07:46.420
you've lost your head!

07:47.210 --> 07:48.010
Sir,

07:49.010 --> 07:50.010
I'm very clear-headed.

07:51.010 --> 07:51.940
I know Fei Ni is too.

07:51.940 --> 07:54.130
Why can't you get it?

07:54.860 --> 07:57.450
Even if Fei Ni has
broken up with Ye Feng,

07:57.500 --> 07:59.693
her mother and I still won't
agree to this marriage.

08:00.740 --> 08:01.500
You should

08:01.500 --> 08:02.890
- just give it up.
- Give it up.

08:03.100 --> 08:03.890
Fei Ni...

08:04.740 --> 08:06.300
Fei Ni, don't be mad.

08:06.300 --> 08:07.500
Why would you suddenly propose?

08:08.860 --> 08:10.130
Don't couples visit both families

08:10.130 --> 08:11.890
before they get married?

08:12.300 --> 08:13.300
My parents aren't here,

08:13.300 --> 08:14.420
so I could only go to yours.

08:14.420 --> 08:15.860
Didn't we agree yesterday

08:15.860 --> 08:17.100
to keep this from them for now?

08:17.250 --> 08:18.010
I don't understand.

08:18.330 --> 08:19.940
Why won't you tell them the truth?

08:20.100 --> 08:21.330
Tell them you're marrying me

08:21.330 --> 08:22.300
just to get a unit.

08:22.300 --> 08:23.130
If I told them

08:23.130 --> 08:25.130
I'm marrying you to free up
a room for my brother,

08:25.130 --> 08:26.848
it would make things harder for them.

08:39.020 --> 08:39.630
Forget it.

08:41.320 --> 08:42.780
It was my idea anyway.

08:48.450 --> 08:49.690
Are you so eager to marry me?

08:51.240 --> 08:53.450
You've forgotten everything,
and you've still got

08:53.450 --> 08:54.330
the nerve.

08:54.660 --> 08:55.810
Stop worrying.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.540
This started because of me.

08:58.960 --> 08:59.940
I'll fix it.

09:01.300 --> 09:02.140
How?

09:02.940 --> 09:04.180
I'll find a way

09:04.490 --> 09:05.660
to make your parents like me.

09:08.730 --> 09:10.690
Now I'm sure
your brain really is damaged.

09:11.020 --> 09:11.940
Don't underestimate me.

09:12.490 --> 09:13.810
I'm very popular at the hospital.

09:14.330 --> 09:15.780
The doctors and nurses all like me.

09:19.690 --> 09:20.410
Stop sighing.

09:21.330 --> 09:22.570
You'll sigh all your luck away.

09:23.610 --> 09:24.610
Just let me try.

09:25.420 --> 09:26.700
We've got nothing to lose.

09:27.490 --> 09:28.490
Fine. Go ahead.

09:31.471 --> 09:32.690
Who are you calling "nothing"?

09:35.300 --> 09:36.200
My dad?

09:38.330 --> 09:39.630
I...

09:39.940 --> 09:40.780
Stop right there!

09:49.440 --> 09:50.000
Mom.

09:50.450 --> 09:51.040
Did you know

09:51.040 --> 09:52.430
Fei Ni was marrying Fang Muyang?

09:52.810 --> 09:53.730
Her marriage

09:53.730 --> 09:54.900
has nothing to do with you.

09:54.900 --> 09:56.330
Of course it does!

09:56.360 --> 09:58.560
Why did you issue them
a letter of introduction?

09:59.140 --> 10:00.690
It's freedom of marriage.

10:00.900 --> 10:02.850
On what grounds would I refuse?

10:02.850 --> 10:04.450
She can't marry Fang Muyang.

10:04.450 --> 10:05.510
Absolutely not!

10:07.140 --> 10:07.900
Ye Feng,

10:08.330 --> 10:11.300
I need to criticize you on this.

10:12.940 --> 10:15.210
You're not even
as clear-headed as Fei Ni.

10:15.610 --> 10:18.090
She knows you two aren't
right for each other.

10:18.090 --> 10:19.090
She stepped back.

10:19.300 --> 10:20.330
She let it go.

10:20.330 --> 10:22.610
But you just won't stop.

10:23.450 --> 10:24.540
No, Mom.

10:25.200 --> 10:26.350
Everyone knows

10:26.350 --> 10:27.690
we were seeing each other.

10:27.970 --> 10:29.540
And now she's marrying Fang Muyang.

10:29.900 --> 10:32.060
What does that make me look like?

10:32.210 --> 10:33.420
You care about your pride?

10:33.660 --> 10:35.060
Then find someone better.

10:35.260 --> 10:36.330
Like Ling Yi.

10:37.137 --> 10:37.940
Let me tell you,

10:37.940 --> 10:39.330
don't think I don't see through you.

10:39.730 --> 10:40.590
You're upset

10:40.590 --> 10:42.604
because Fei Ni got
into Fang Muyang's bike.

10:43.210 --> 10:44.410
You feel humiliated.

10:44.410 --> 10:45.330
You want to save face.

10:45.420 --> 10:47.400
Just give up on that idea.

10:47.690 --> 10:49.020
Stop pestering her.

10:49.610 --> 10:51.400
Otherwise, you really will lose face.

10:51.610 --> 10:52.780
Mom, that's not...

10:52.780 --> 10:53.570
Enough.

10:54.090 --> 10:55.140
It's settled!

11:04.810 --> 11:06.540
Go buy some movie tickets later.

11:07.260 --> 11:08.450
Take Ling Yi to the movies.

11:09.260 --> 11:11.140
And after that, go for a walk together.

11:11.730 --> 11:12.940
If you dare not go,

11:13.690 --> 11:15.210
don't even think about coming home.

11:15.540 --> 11:16.690
You're on your own.

11:36.337 --> 11:37.530
Ms. Fang, Ms. Ding, goodbye.

11:37.690 --> 11:38.230
Goodbye.

11:38.260 --> 11:38.850
Goodbye.

11:40.690 --> 11:41.850
Ms. Fang, let's go together.

11:43.110 --> 11:45.020
No, I still have some work to finish.

11:46.970 --> 11:48.610
Oh, right, tomorrow's Sunday.

11:48.610 --> 11:49.540
Let's go see a movie.

11:51.610 --> 11:52.450
Sure.

11:54.260 --> 11:58.820
(Math Department Staff Office)

12:12.060 --> 12:17.100
(1975, Year of the Rabbit)

12:18.960 --> 12:21.450
(Fang, about this research project...)

12:21.840 --> 12:23.540
(After careful consideration,)

12:23.900 --> 12:26.330
(the organization feels
you're not the right fit.)

12:26.582 --> 12:28.450
(His father is
a senior military officer,)

12:28.680 --> 12:29.730
(his mother serves too.)

12:30.210 --> 12:32.140
(He comes from a top cadre family.)

12:32.690 --> 12:34.060
Have you truly cut ties

12:34.810 --> 12:35.730
with your parents

12:36.780 --> 12:37.690
and your family?

13:12.000 --> 13:12.990
Look at you.

13:13.570 --> 13:15.690
You couldn't even
persuade Fang Muyang.

13:16.540 --> 13:18.330
And you persuaded Fei Ni?

13:18.330 --> 13:19.960
Is that even comparable?

13:20.420 --> 13:21.380
Keep your voice down.

13:24.650 --> 13:26.420
You know how stubborn Ni is.

13:26.420 --> 13:27.426
You've seen it yourself.

13:28.140 --> 13:29.900
But Fang Muyang's just a fool.

13:29.900 --> 13:31.315
And you can't even handle that.

13:31.610 --> 13:33.850
That makes him even harder to deal with.

13:34.420 --> 13:35.660
He won't listen.

13:36.090 --> 13:37.180
You can't reason with him.

13:39.020 --> 13:40.450
Fang Muyang is

13:40.730 --> 13:41.900
much more trouble than Fei Ni.

13:43.330 --> 13:44.330
So what do we do now?

13:47.530 --> 13:50.090
It's easy to understand

13:50.850 --> 13:52.210
why Fang Muyang likes Ni.

13:52.490 --> 13:54.730
I mean, Ni's such a good girl.

13:54.730 --> 13:55.760
Who wouldn't like her?

13:55.850 --> 13:56.540
Exactly.

13:56.540 --> 13:59.490
But Ni likes Fang Muyang?

14:00.850 --> 14:01.940
That's the problem.

14:02.420 --> 14:04.810
Who falls for a fool?

14:07.570 --> 14:08.660
Something's off.

14:09.660 --> 14:10.540
What do you mean?

14:17.020 --> 14:17.900
I don't know.

14:18.540 --> 14:20.330
But lately,

14:20.330 --> 14:21.660
she's not herself.

14:22.450 --> 14:22.940
Let's sleep.

14:23.330 --> 14:24.540
Go to sleep.

14:40.300 --> 14:48.780
(Math Department Staff Office)

14:53.900 --> 14:54.690
Long time no see.

14:58.610 --> 14:59.690
Here for Professor Wu?

15:03.450 --> 15:03.810
No.

15:05.090 --> 15:06.020
I'm here for you.

15:13.730 --> 15:14.610
Do you have a minute?

15:15.300 --> 15:16.140
Take a walk with me?

15:53.440 --> 15:54.560
Have you been busy lately?

15:57.280 --> 15:58.690
I thought you weren't going to ask.

16:01.140 --> 16:02.400
Are you going to answer?

16:03.520 --> 16:05.690
I went to the countryside
with a medical team.

16:05.810 --> 16:07.060
I just got back this morning.

16:08.330 --> 16:09.660
I wasn't avoiding you.

16:11.900 --> 16:12.850
I didn't ask that.

16:14.900 --> 16:15.970
Then just take it as

16:16.700 --> 16:17.810
a clarification from me.

16:19.493 --> 16:21.330
I've been thinking
a lot these past few days.

16:22.900 --> 16:23.660
About you.

16:31.610 --> 16:32.810
About your family background.

16:33.540 --> 16:34.660
To be honest,

16:35.330 --> 16:36.450
as a partner,

16:36.900 --> 16:38.540
you're not my best option.

16:39.060 --> 16:40.850
The doctors at our hospital,

16:41.140 --> 16:42.540
my father's comrade's daughter,

16:42.660 --> 16:45.210
even the teachers at your school,

16:45.900 --> 16:47.810
would all be more suitable than you

16:48.140 --> 16:49.490
from a practical standpoint.

16:52.260 --> 16:54.300
Isn't it too early
to talk about marriage?

16:55.140 --> 16:56.610
We've only met a few times.

16:57.900 --> 16:58.850
But for me,

16:58.850 --> 17:00.060
that's already enough.

17:02.260 --> 17:02.940
Fang Mujing,

17:03.690 --> 17:05.340
I came here to ask you one thing.

17:07.600 --> 17:08.570
Will you marry me?

17:17.340 --> 17:18.690
You just said we're not suitable.

17:18.820 --> 17:20.900
That's right. We're not.

17:22.140 --> 17:23.860
But I'm not a pragmatist.

17:25.530 --> 17:26.940
So I'm still choosing you.

17:30.650 --> 17:31.620
I'm sorry, Qu Hua.

17:32.140 --> 17:33.530
I have plenty of choices too.

17:34.420 --> 17:36.690
And in my view,
many are better than you.

17:36.820 --> 17:37.690
More suitable.

17:38.490 --> 17:41.250
For example, teachers at our school,

17:41.690 --> 17:43.100
my former university classmates,

17:44.420 --> 17:45.690
even a doctor like you,

17:45.760 --> 17:47.737
except he's already
a deputy hospital director.

17:48.210 --> 17:49.290
And unlike you,

17:49.530 --> 17:51.530
I happen to be a pragmatist.

17:53.340 --> 17:55.210
If you're a pragmatist,

17:56.140 --> 17:57.290
then you should choose me.

17:57.690 --> 17:58.490
Oh?

17:59.290 --> 18:00.940
You come
from a political background,

18:01.210 --> 18:01.860
while I

18:01.860 --> 18:03.690
come from
a "black five categories" family.

18:04.290 --> 18:05.690
So when you propose,

18:05.690 --> 18:06.940
I should just accept it?

18:09.140 --> 18:10.100
You're a smart lady.

18:10.690 --> 18:11.490
So am I.

18:12.140 --> 18:14.140
Smart people don't need pleasantries.

18:14.660 --> 18:15.290
So,

18:16.530 --> 18:19.900
yes, I do think you should
accept without hesitation.

18:26.690 --> 18:27.860
I need some time.

18:58.450 --> 18:59.120
Fang Mujing,

19:00.040 --> 19:01.820
you've been sitting here
for three hours.

19:03.000 --> 19:04.290
For us doctors,

19:04.290 --> 19:05.860
time is precious.

19:06.450 --> 19:07.530
Three hours is enough

19:07.900 --> 19:09.290
for me to save a life.

19:10.940 --> 19:12.140
This is about marriage.

19:12.690 --> 19:14.040
Shouldn't I think it through?

19:16.380 --> 19:17.540
But you're not thinking.

19:18.420 --> 19:19.940
When I asked you earlier,

19:20.420 --> 19:21.840
you already had your answer.

19:22.780 --> 19:24.210
You just didn't say it.

19:28.100 --> 19:29.290
And what is my answer?

19:30.490 --> 19:31.120
I don't know.

19:31.690 --> 19:32.900
Then why not ask?

19:40.850 --> 19:41.450
Fang Mujing,

19:42.690 --> 19:43.870
will you marry me?

19:47.340 --> 19:48.040
I will.

20:30.990 --> 20:33.200
Playing chess with you is exhausting.

20:36.620 --> 20:39.010
Liu, don't be so impatient.

20:39.420 --> 20:42.690
Chess is all about staying calm.

20:43.340 --> 20:45.050
One wrong move,

20:45.340 --> 20:47.290
and you lose the whole game.

20:49.340 --> 20:50.140
Mr. Fei.

20:51.530 --> 20:52.450
You scared me.

20:52.450 --> 20:54.210
What are you doing here?

20:54.620 --> 20:55.530
I came to see you.

20:55.660 --> 20:56.770
I never ask for that.

20:57.210 --> 20:58.860
Come on, are we playing or not?

20:58.860 --> 20:59.530
Of course...

21:00.250 --> 21:01.100
Of course not!

21:01.100 --> 21:02.960
I was about to make a great move,

21:02.960 --> 21:03.940
then he shows up

21:03.940 --> 21:05.340
and throws me off.

21:05.340 --> 21:06.340
That's not fair.

21:07.140 --> 21:08.140
You and your excuses.

21:08.250 --> 21:09.250
A loss is a loss.

21:09.250 --> 21:11.980
You'd lose even if he hadn't come.

21:11.980 --> 21:12.980
No way.

21:12.980 --> 21:14.290
When have I ever lost?

21:14.290 --> 21:15.940
Mr. Fei is amazing at chess.

21:16.050 --> 21:17.290
He taught me everything I know.

21:21.730 --> 21:23.090
Stop egging him on.

21:23.940 --> 21:24.570
Fei,

21:25.380 --> 21:26.570
I'll give you a Horse.

21:26.570 --> 21:27.530
I'll give you a Chariot.

21:28.760 --> 21:29.380
How about this?

21:29.660 --> 21:30.980
If Mr. Fei wins like that,

21:31.220 --> 21:32.090
it won't count.

21:32.330 --> 21:33.380
I'll play for him.

21:33.660 --> 21:34.490
I'm his apprentice.

21:34.530 --> 21:35.620
- Not bad, Fei.
- Come on.

21:35.620 --> 21:37.330
Since when did you
take on an apprentice?

21:38.004 --> 21:39.180
I'm tired of playing with you.

21:39.700 --> 21:40.940
Fine, let's have a match.

21:43.730 --> 21:46.180
But it's no fun without stakes.

21:46.180 --> 21:47.290
What are we playing for?

21:47.330 --> 21:48.010
Alright.

21:48.010 --> 21:49.140
You name it.

21:49.140 --> 21:49.940
Watermelon.

21:50.570 --> 21:51.490
A big one.

21:51.570 --> 21:52.860
No problem.

21:54.090 --> 21:55.490
And if I win?

22:07.500 --> 22:08.980
(Wuliangye)

22:09.330 --> 22:11.140
These two bottles of liquor
and this chess set

22:11.330 --> 22:13.180
were meant
as a gift for Mr. Fei.

22:13.530 --> 22:15.570
If you win, they're yours.

22:16.290 --> 22:17.050
No way!

22:17.050 --> 22:17.980
Don't touch it.

22:19.330 --> 22:20.250
That's the one.

22:20.490 --> 22:21.730
If I lose,

22:22.180 --> 22:23.900
I'll buy you watermelon for a week.

22:25.570 --> 22:26.330
Deal.

22:27.620 --> 22:28.250
Are you sure?

22:29.850 --> 22:30.350
Mr. Fei,

22:31.010 --> 22:31.620
trust me.

22:36.660 --> 22:38.180
A jar of clam cream, too.

22:38.730 --> 22:39.250
Alright.

22:43.730 --> 22:44.420
Fei Ni,

22:44.915 --> 22:46.770
I was just about
to look for you after work.

22:46.893 --> 22:47.900
And some vanishing cream.

22:48.090 --> 22:49.400
No, not the loose packs.

22:49.940 --> 22:50.890
The bottled one.

22:52.730 --> 22:54.250
Buying something this expensive?

22:55.180 --> 22:56.980
Things must be
getting serious with Ye Feng.

22:57.180 --> 22:58.350
Is that for his mother?

22:58.530 --> 22:59.570
It's not for his mother.

22:59.570 --> 23:01.140
It's for mine. How much?

23:01.140 --> 23:01.900
Five yuan.

23:03.250 --> 23:04.490
Shouldn't Ye Feng be paying?

23:07.090 --> 23:08.090
I turned him down.

23:10.730 --> 23:11.730
You're about to lose.

23:13.050 --> 23:14.660
This kid's really good.

23:16.940 --> 23:18.330
Make your move. Stop stalling.

23:18.330 --> 23:19.870
Hurry up.

23:20.330 --> 23:22.180
Stop stalling.

23:23.090 --> 23:24.570
It's just one move.

23:24.570 --> 23:25.220
How about

23:25.620 --> 23:26.660
you just admit defeat?

23:32.660 --> 23:33.290
Check.

23:34.330 --> 23:36.330
Mr. Liu, you're out of moves.

23:36.490 --> 23:37.330
Liu,

23:37.330 --> 23:39.490
how many games
have you lost now?

23:39.730 --> 23:41.380
How many big watermelons
do you owe me?

23:41.380 --> 23:42.180
How about this?

23:42.330 --> 23:44.140
We'll spot him a Horse. No,

23:44.182 --> 23:45.460
a Chariot, a Horse, and a Canon.

23:45.730 --> 23:46.290
Sure.

23:48.530 --> 23:49.250
I'm done playing!

23:50.980 --> 23:52.180
Where are you going?

23:52.250 --> 23:53.290
To buy watermelons.

23:55.180 --> 23:56.940
Fei, your apprentice is impressive.

23:57.420 --> 23:59.810
That's because Mr. Fei taught me well.

24:00.700 --> 24:02.180
Stay humble.

24:02.180 --> 24:03.530
Young people need discipline.

24:04.330 --> 24:07.420
Let's drink in celebration today!

24:07.420 --> 24:07.900
Fei,

24:08.250 --> 24:09.330
I heard you beat Liu.

24:09.660 --> 24:11.490
Just a small win.

24:12.660 --> 24:14.180
That's a huge watermelon.

24:15.380 --> 24:16.730
Fei, who's this?

24:16.730 --> 24:18.490
My chess apprentice.

24:18.810 --> 24:19.270
Nice.

24:22.050 --> 24:23.180
What are you doing?

24:24.490 --> 24:25.900
This watermelon I won

24:26.140 --> 24:26.980
and this liquor

24:27.460 --> 24:28.530
are all for you.

24:31.940 --> 24:34.330
Ni's mother went back
to her parents' today.

24:34.660 --> 24:35.980
Otherwise,

24:35.980 --> 24:37.330
you wouldn't have set foot in here.

24:37.980 --> 24:38.770
Yes, of course.

24:39.140 --> 24:39.980
Come in.

24:45.330 --> 24:46.660
What were you thinking?

24:46.960 --> 24:48.090
Even if Ye Feng is no good,

24:48.090 --> 24:49.770
you can't marry Fang Muyang.

24:50.460 --> 24:51.810
No wonder your parents won't agree.

24:54.290 --> 24:56.050
Why are you saying that too?

24:58.730 --> 25:00.860
Fei Ni, I know you're rushing

25:00.860 --> 25:02.940
into marriage
to free up the room for us.

25:04.250 --> 25:04.790
If you were

25:04.790 --> 25:06.380
marrying someone like Ye Feng,

25:06.770 --> 25:08.530
of course, I'd hope you'd marry soon.

25:09.140 --> 25:10.730
But if it's someone like Fang Muyang,

25:11.090 --> 25:12.330
even if you give us the room,

25:12.330 --> 25:13.460
I wouldn't dare move in.

25:14.700 --> 25:15.770
You'd actually marry a fool

25:16.090 --> 25:17.700
for our sake?

25:18.980 --> 25:19.940
No, Fei Ni.

25:19.980 --> 25:21.140
I can't let you do that.

25:21.204 --> 25:22.660
Your brother wouldn't agree either.

25:23.900 --> 25:24.980
Lin Mei,

25:26.570 --> 25:28.160
I'm marrying Fang Muyang

25:29.190 --> 25:30.730
not for you or my brother.

25:31.570 --> 25:32.980
I'm doing it for myself.

25:34.730 --> 25:35.250
And besides,

25:36.090 --> 25:37.820
Fang Muyang just lost his memory.

25:37.980 --> 25:39.770
It's not like he's mentally impaired.

25:40.180 --> 25:41.900
He's not as bad
as you make him out to be.

25:43.250 --> 25:44.490
He's physically healthy,

25:44.980 --> 25:45.980
he has good character,

25:46.460 --> 25:47.460
and he can draw.

25:48.050 --> 25:49.730
He can earn his own money now.

25:50.730 --> 25:52.050
Most importantly,

25:54.460 --> 25:55.730
the factory can give him a unit.

25:59.700 --> 26:00.980
But at the end of the day,

26:01.180 --> 26:02.770
he had a head injury.

26:02.848 --> 26:04.330
What if there are lasting effects?

26:06.330 --> 26:07.010
Fei Ni,

26:07.810 --> 26:10.050
maybe Fang Muyang isn't that bad,

26:11.050 --> 26:12.660
but you could definitely do better.

26:18.660 --> 26:19.900
Right now,

26:20.860 --> 26:22.700
Fang Muyang is the best choice.

26:23.330 --> 26:25.090
Lin Mei, trust me.

26:25.460 --> 26:27.700
I wouldn't risk ruining my whole future.

26:32.140 --> 26:34.490
Even if I agree,

26:35.250 --> 26:36.330
your brother won't.

26:36.330 --> 26:38.330
Then don't tell him.

26:38.730 --> 26:40.050
He'll find out eventually.

26:40.050 --> 26:40.900
He'll blame me.

26:41.220 --> 26:42.330
He won't.

26:42.330 --> 26:43.460
How could he?

26:43.700 --> 26:45.250
If you tell him now,

26:45.250 --> 26:46.700
you'll just make things worse.

26:46.700 --> 26:48.250
I can barely handle my parents as it is.

26:48.250 --> 26:49.730
If Fei Ting gets involved too...

26:51.770 --> 26:52.980
then I might as well die.

26:53.900 --> 26:54.570
Don't say that.

26:54.730 --> 26:55.380
Touch wood.

27:02.570 --> 27:03.290
Alright.

27:04.810 --> 27:06.250
What can I do to help?

27:07.240 --> 27:08.330
Keep it a secret.

27:15.140 --> 27:16.940
Wait here.
I'll grab you a couple of cans.

27:24.730 --> 27:25.570
Master,

27:26.050 --> 27:28.460
I just braised some beef.
Have a taste.

27:29.220 --> 27:29.770
Fang,

27:30.140 --> 27:31.860
don't simply call anyone master.

27:32.090 --> 27:33.940
I only let it slide earlier

27:33.940 --> 27:35.570
to save your face.

27:37.380 --> 27:38.180
Alright.

27:38.980 --> 27:39.770
Mr. Fei.

27:43.848 --> 27:44.980
Let's have a drink.

27:48.330 --> 27:49.570
Comrade Fang,

27:49.940 --> 27:52.050
given where we stand right now,

27:52.090 --> 27:54.050
it's not appropriate
for us to drink together.

27:57.860 --> 27:58.530
Sure.

27:58.530 --> 27:59.290
Alright.

28:02.980 --> 28:03.730
Hello?

28:04.330 --> 28:05.730
Is this Qianjin Farm?

28:06.380 --> 28:07.570
I'm looking for Fei Ting.

28:16.090 --> 28:17.700
(Car)
This thing isn't cheap, is it?

28:17.940 --> 28:19.010
Where did you get it?

28:21.250 --> 28:22.050
I made it.

28:25.420 --> 28:26.860
You made it?

28:27.250 --> 28:27.810
Yeah.

28:28.900 --> 28:31.660
Fei Ni told me
you like playing chess.

28:32.250 --> 28:33.530
I went around a few shops.

28:33.700 --> 28:35.290
The cheap ones wouldn't suit you.

28:35.290 --> 28:36.271
And the good ones...

28:37.570 --> 28:39.140
I can't afford those.

28:39.315 --> 28:41.140
One of my classmates
from the training course

28:41.140 --> 28:43.090
had a broken
red sandalwood chair at home.

28:43.090 --> 28:44.860
So I paid a little
and bought the wood.

28:45.460 --> 28:46.490
I carved them one by one.

28:49.490 --> 28:50.290
It wasn't hard.

28:51.140 --> 28:53.140
You've got some skills after all.

29:01.660 --> 29:02.250
Mr. Fei,

29:05.090 --> 29:06.330
I can do a lot of things.

29:08.090 --> 29:09.010
I won't go hungry.

29:12.330 --> 29:14.620
I know why you're doing this.

29:16.220 --> 29:18.010
You want her mother and me

29:18.010 --> 29:20.490
to agree to your marriage with Ni.

29:20.700 --> 29:21.250
I also know

29:21.420 --> 29:23.900
you truly care about our Ni.

29:24.220 --> 29:25.530
She's such a good girl.

29:25.530 --> 29:26.530
Who wouldn't like her?

29:26.700 --> 29:27.140
Right?

29:27.770 --> 29:29.290
But let's be honest.

29:30.250 --> 29:30.810
A good family

29:31.330 --> 29:32.004
and background

29:32.730 --> 29:35.140
are solid and objective conditions.

29:35.460 --> 29:38.050
But feelings are subjective.

29:38.050 --> 29:39.140
They're fragile.

29:39.570 --> 29:42.090
What matters most is living well,

29:42.090 --> 29:44.530
building a steady,
grounded life. Right?

29:52.730 --> 29:53.530
Yes.

29:54.140 --> 29:54.940
You're right.

29:56.250 --> 29:56.980
I admit it.

29:57.810 --> 29:59.460
Ye Feng has a good family.

30:00.140 --> 30:01.460
But that doesn't mean

30:02.290 --> 30:03.900
Fei Ni will live happily.

30:04.900 --> 30:06.330
Now that's far-fetched.

30:06.940 --> 30:08.420
Did Fei Ni tell you

30:08.660 --> 30:10.290
why she broke up with Ye Feng?

30:16.900 --> 30:18.010
Unbelievable.

30:18.010 --> 30:20.140
So all that braised beef went to waste.

30:20.140 --> 30:21.700
Mr. Fei, please.

30:22.220 --> 30:24.090
Don't get upset.

30:29.700 --> 30:30.490
Mr. Fei,

30:32.140 --> 30:32.940
to me,

30:33.460 --> 30:35.180
Fei Ni is the best in the world.

30:36.730 --> 30:37.940
She's one of a kind.

30:38.700 --> 30:39.530
I understand her.

30:40.140 --> 30:40.940
I respect her.

30:41.460 --> 30:42.620
But in Ye Feng's eyes,

30:42.940 --> 30:44.220
she's just a worker

30:45.860 --> 30:47.420
trying to marry up.

30:49.090 --> 30:50.220
So tell me, Mr. Fei.

30:50.730 --> 30:51.900
What should she choose?

30:52.090 --> 30:54.010
Of course, I want her to choose someone

30:54.010 --> 30:55.700
who cherishes her,

30:55.700 --> 30:57.140
protects her, respects her.

30:59.810 --> 31:00.660
You know,

31:01.330 --> 31:02.660
going to university

31:02.770 --> 31:04.010
is Fei Ni's dream.

31:04.700 --> 31:05.940
It's what she wants most.

31:06.900 --> 31:08.090
But in Ye Feng's eyes,

31:08.700 --> 31:10.530
it's just her way of marrying up

31:10.530 --> 31:12.090
or landing a better job.

31:15.620 --> 31:17.050
Not only is she not cherished,

31:17.804 --> 31:18.940
but she's looked down on.

31:24.420 --> 31:25.220
Mr. Fei,

31:25.860 --> 31:27.090
maybe Mrs. Fei and you think

31:27.660 --> 31:28.700
that marrying someone

31:28.900 --> 31:30.530
with better means matters more.

31:31.730 --> 31:33.530
But if that person doesn't value her,

31:34.900 --> 31:36.290
no matter how great his family is,

31:36.940 --> 31:37.730
it means nothing.

31:39.090 --> 31:39.640
Right?

31:44.220 --> 31:45.530
So what you're saying is,

31:45.940 --> 31:48.330
you support Fei Ni going to university?

31:48.700 --> 31:50.420
I do. I fully support her.

31:50.715 --> 31:51.460
If she needs it,

31:51.460 --> 31:52.460
I'll help her.

32:03.530 --> 32:04.700
I see.

32:04.860 --> 32:06.900
No wonder our Ni likes you.

32:09.010 --> 32:10.330
Let's say, just hypothetically...

32:10.330 --> 32:11.530
Purely hypothetically speaking,

32:11.620 --> 32:12.450
if I agree

32:12.730 --> 32:15.260
to your marriage today,

32:16.010 --> 32:17.590
can you promise me

32:17.810 --> 32:19.660
that everything you said today is true?

32:22.460 --> 32:23.250
Mr. Fei,

32:23.940 --> 32:24.900
I promise you,

32:25.660 --> 32:27.330
every word I said today is true.

32:28.420 --> 32:29.460
And I'll stand by it.

32:38.140 --> 32:39.250
Let's drink, just us two.

32:43.220 --> 32:44.140
Don't just sit there

32:44.140 --> 32:46.620
with the chessboard
between us like a border.

32:46.620 --> 32:47.730
Come here.

32:47.940 --> 32:48.980
Come on.

32:52.380 --> 32:56.290
I may just pull curtains
at the theater now,

32:56.770 --> 32:58.770
but thirty years ago,

32:58.980 --> 33:01.980
I was the star
of our city's Peking Opera troupe.

33:01.980 --> 33:08.700
Even if the sky falls, so what?

33:15.770 --> 33:17.980
You know Tai Chi?

33:19.330 --> 33:20.530
The Tai Chi I practice

33:20.530 --> 33:22.530
has been passed
down in the Fei family.

33:22.530 --> 33:24.770
The 72 Forms of Fei-style Tai Chi.

33:25.490 --> 33:26.090
Push harder.

33:26.090 --> 33:27.420
Use all your strength.

33:27.620 --> 33:28.290
Harder.

33:28.370 --> 33:29.700
Harder.

33:29.700 --> 33:30.750
There you go.

33:32.770 --> 33:33.530
Mr. Fei,

33:33.530 --> 33:35.380
you could
teach classes with that skill.

33:37.250 --> 33:39.120
It'd be a shame
not to pass it down.

33:40.290 --> 33:41.050
How about this?

33:41.330 --> 33:42.448
When the time comes,

33:42.730 --> 33:45.530
I'll illustrate all 72 forms,

33:45.530 --> 33:47.290
add explanations,
bind them into a book,

33:47.448 --> 33:48.700
and give a copy to everyone

33:48.770 --> 33:51.180
so they can all admire your style.

33:53.090 --> 33:53.900
But Mr. Fei,

33:54.660 --> 33:55.770
the urgent matter

33:56.380 --> 33:57.900
is my marriage with Fei Ni.

33:58.900 --> 34:00.050
You've agreed,

34:00.530 --> 34:01.530
but this household

34:01.730 --> 34:03.140
has another half holding it up.

34:14.130 --> 34:14.940
There's a way?

34:15.170 --> 34:15.980
Let me think.

34:20.980 --> 34:23.300
(Teaching Building)

34:23.300 --> 34:24.530
Just these two questions.

34:25.130 --> 34:25.940
Revise them at home.

34:25.940 --> 34:27.271
-Alright, I understand.
-Good.

34:50.690 --> 34:51.340
Professor Wu,

34:53.300 --> 34:54.690
Qu Hua and I are getting married.

34:55.026 --> 34:56.380
Please have some wedding candy.

34:58.690 --> 34:59.490
Qu Hua?

35:01.130 --> 35:03.340
I didn't expect things to move so fast.

35:05.570 --> 35:06.490
Neither did I.

35:07.780 --> 35:08.690
But overall,

35:09.010 --> 35:10.380
I don't think it's a bad thing.

35:11.780 --> 35:12.780
What do you see in him?

35:16.380 --> 35:17.460
He comes from a good family.

35:19.490 --> 35:20.570
What else

35:20.650 --> 35:21.780
do you know about him?

35:22.780 --> 35:24.260
He's a neurosurgeon.

35:24.980 --> 35:25.900
Good-looking,

35:25.980 --> 35:26.900
steady temperament,

35:27.226 --> 35:28.300
and top-notch skills.

35:29.130 --> 35:30.980
Knowing just that probably isn't enough.

35:31.740 --> 35:33.340
What about his past relationships?

35:33.570 --> 35:34.570
Who did he date?

35:34.570 --> 35:35.740
Why did they break up?

35:35.860 --> 35:38.050
Aren't you going to look into that?

35:39.340 --> 35:41.780
To me, that's all in the past.

35:41.860 --> 35:42.650
It doesn't matter,

35:43.340 --> 35:45.530
as long as he comes
from a revolutionary family.

35:48.340 --> 35:50.340
Professor Wu, once I marry him,

35:50.340 --> 35:50.780
can I

35:50.780 --> 35:52.530
join the project team?

35:54.980 --> 35:57.570
Once you become a military spouse,
of course, you can.

35:58.260 --> 35:59.300
But Fang,

35:59.860 --> 36:02.490
is sacrificing your personal feelings

36:03.050 --> 36:03.900
worth it?

36:06.340 --> 36:07.130
It is.

36:08.650 --> 36:11.170
And to me,
it's not even a sacrifice.

36:13.740 --> 36:14.530
Fang.

36:15.260 --> 36:16.690
Sometimes, life

36:16.740 --> 36:18.300
is like our algorithm research.

36:18.570 --> 36:20.730
You may have to go through
countless trials and errors

36:20.740 --> 36:22.340
before you find the right answer.

36:22.780 --> 36:23.980
I hope you treat love

36:23.980 --> 36:26.690
with the same
perseverance as research.

36:26.980 --> 36:28.740
But remember,

36:29.570 --> 36:30.980
once you spot

36:30.980 --> 36:31.780
a miscalculation,

36:32.820 --> 36:33.980
don't cling to it blindly.

36:37.860 --> 36:39.300
Are you saying

36:39.740 --> 36:41.490
you don't have
high hopes for my marriage?

36:43.130 --> 36:44.570
Whether I approve isn't what matters.

36:44.570 --> 36:45.980
What matters is

36:45.980 --> 36:47.300
whether you're ready.

36:48.090 --> 36:49.980
After all,
you haven't known each other long.

36:50.130 --> 36:52.380
You might not know him that well.

36:54.650 --> 36:55.570
That's true.

36:56.050 --> 36:57.780
But for me, it's enough.

36:59.340 --> 37:00.490
Thank you, Professor Wu.

37:01.050 --> 37:02.650
I'll go draft the application.

37:20.170 --> 37:22.130
When we get to my place, just say

37:22.130 --> 37:23.780
you bought these for my mom.

37:25.650 --> 37:26.170
Alright.

37:26.650 --> 37:27.490
I'll pay you back.

37:27.490 --> 37:30.130
No need. Why are we talking money?

37:30.460 --> 37:31.210
Fair enough.

37:31.248 --> 37:33.260
Sooner or later,
what's mine is yours anyway.

37:33.780 --> 37:36.900
I'm still not sure
this is going to work.

37:38.900 --> 37:42.300
Just try to make a good impression.

37:42.937 --> 37:43.980
And when we're there,

37:43.980 --> 37:45.900
don't be so polite with me.

37:45.900 --> 37:47.440
We're supposed to look like a couple.

37:47.490 --> 37:48.980
We're not even registered yet.

37:49.090 --> 37:50.130
We're not a couple yet.

37:50.293 --> 37:51.260
When are we registering?

37:51.980 --> 37:55.090
Only after our parents agree.

37:55.900 --> 37:56.740
"Our parents?"

37:56.740 --> 37:57.260
No.

37:57.530 --> 38:00.170
- The Fei Family Tai Chi Manual.
- The Fei Family Tai Chi Manual.

38:06.570 --> 38:09.010
Open it. Take a look.

38:15.860 --> 38:17.570
Fei, that's you?

38:18.650 --> 38:19.900
You can't tell?

38:19.900 --> 38:22.260
I had no idea you practiced Tai Chi.

38:23.780 --> 38:26.050
Plenty of people practice Tai Chi.

38:26.090 --> 38:28.130
But how many
publish their own manual?

38:28.530 --> 38:30.570
Fei, who put this together for you?

38:31.090 --> 38:31.690
My apprentice.

38:31.690 --> 38:32.300
Fang.

38:32.980 --> 38:34.050
As the saying goes,

38:34.170 --> 38:35.170
a man

38:35.170 --> 38:36.300
leaves his name behind.

38:36.300 --> 38:37.490
And I, Fei,

38:37.690 --> 38:41.490
finally have a book of my own.

38:43.090 --> 38:44.900
Would you like to learn it, too?

38:45.570 --> 38:46.210
Are you in?

38:46.210 --> 38:47.130
Yes or no?

38:47.690 --> 38:49.980
Tai Chi is good stuff. Come on.

38:50.170 --> 38:52.020
- Sign me up!
- I want to learn!

38:52.020 --> 38:54.460
- Sign me up!
- Make a few more copies.

38:54.610 --> 38:56.000
- Make a few more.
- Yes!

38:56.210 --> 38:59.040
- Let's all learn.
- This is a martial arts manual.

38:59.130 --> 39:00.380
It's not mass-produced.

39:00.380 --> 39:01.460
I can't just make more.

39:02.380 --> 39:03.380
How about this?

39:03.490 --> 39:05.340
If you truly want to learn,

39:05.340 --> 39:07.260
I'll sincerely teach you.

39:07.340 --> 39:09.170
Call me Master Fei,

39:09.340 --> 39:11.260
and I'll teach you for free.

39:11.671 --> 39:13.090
- Teacher Fei!
- Teacher Fei!

39:13.090 --> 39:14.600
Master Fei, we want to learn!

39:14.600 --> 39:15.848
- Master Fei!
- Master Fei!

39:15.871 --> 39:17.360
- Sign me up now!
- Me too!

39:18.090 --> 39:20.090
Fang Muyang, you can stop now.

39:21.440 --> 39:24.390
- Fang Muyang, there are people here.
- Isn't that Fei Ni?

39:24.390 --> 39:25.740
Stop it. Hurry up.

39:25.900 --> 39:27.530
Mr. Liu, no chess today?

39:27.530 --> 39:28.650
Get lost, kid.

39:28.650 --> 39:30.340
Fang Muyang, stop. Stop!

39:31.780 --> 39:32.990
Isn't that Fei's daughter?

39:33.700 --> 39:35.920
Left leg first.

39:36.300 --> 39:41.530
Draw in the energy of heaven
and earth through the crown.

39:41.570 --> 39:44.130
Let it sink to your dantian.

39:44.980 --> 39:47.180
Mr. Fei, that's a lot of students.

39:48.090 --> 39:49.380
Who's that young man?

39:49.470 --> 39:50.110
No idea.

39:50.300 --> 39:51.570
All thanks to your manual.

39:52.090 --> 39:52.740
Fang,

39:52.740 --> 39:54.340
you did a great job on that manual.

39:54.340 --> 39:55.780
- Yeah.
- It looks great.

39:55.780 --> 39:57.490
It's beautifully drawn.

39:57.660 --> 39:58.250
Dad...

39:58.650 --> 39:59.460
Go upstairs.

40:02.570 --> 40:03.010
Wait...

40:06.210 --> 40:06.820
Go on.

40:06.820 --> 40:07.490
But...

40:10.940 --> 40:11.650
Fei,

40:11.980 --> 40:14.170
your apprentice became your son-in-law.

40:17.115 --> 40:18.570
That's between the youngsters.

40:18.690 --> 40:19.530
Who knows?

40:21.690 --> 40:24.260
Hey, don't pose like a turtle.

40:24.260 --> 40:25.170
Move.

40:26.760 --> 40:27.780
Stand properly.

40:28.530 --> 40:30.340
Half an hour,
then you're dismissed.

40:30.820 --> 40:31.900
We continue tomorrow.

40:33.570 --> 40:34.420
Hold it steady.

40:39.090 --> 40:40.090
What's going on?

40:40.340 --> 40:41.170
What manual?

40:41.170 --> 40:42.893
Why were you
exchanging looks with my dad?

40:43.404 --> 40:44.350
That's not important.

40:44.860 --> 40:46.210
Your dad's on our side now.

40:46.210 --> 40:47.130
We're allies.

40:49.510 --> 40:50.490
Listen,

40:50.980 --> 40:52.530
until your mom says yes,

40:52.530 --> 40:53.940
don't rat me out.

40:57.090 --> 40:57.650
Dad,

40:58.380 --> 41:00.340
you really agree to our marriage?

41:02.570 --> 41:04.860
Ni, let me ask you this.

41:05.260 --> 41:07.130
Why are you so determined to marry him?

41:10.170 --> 41:10.940
I...

41:23.530 --> 41:25.780
Because he respects
and supports my dreams.

41:26.130 --> 41:28.380
I believe we'll build
a good life together.

41:33.130 --> 41:34.050
That's enough for me.

41:35.490 --> 41:36.570
As for me,

41:36.980 --> 41:39.570
you've passed my test.

41:39.980 --> 41:40.980
As for your mom,

41:41.460 --> 41:42.570
that depends on

41:42.570 --> 41:44.980
whether our preemptive strike works.

41:46.650 --> 41:48.300
A preemptive strike?

41:54.820 --> 41:55.650
Wang,

41:55.780 --> 41:57.940
why are you practicing Tai Chi?

41:58.740 --> 42:01.760
Fei's apprentice published a manual.

42:01.830 --> 42:03.490
We're practicing from it.

42:03.570 --> 42:04.330
Apprentice?

42:04.460 --> 42:05.260
Who?

42:05.820 --> 42:07.050
The young lad Fang.

42:07.050 --> 42:08.380
The young hero.

42:09.010 --> 42:09.650
Baoying,

42:10.050 --> 42:11.190
are you handing out

42:11.300 --> 42:12.360
wedding candy soon?

42:13.300 --> 42:14.300
What wedding candy?

42:14.310 --> 42:15.460
Wedding candy!

42:23.420 --> 42:23.940
Madam Wu,

42:23.940 --> 42:24.870
you're so lucky.

42:30.610 --> 42:31.780
Auntie Wu, you're back.

42:31.780 --> 42:32.780
Congratulations.

42:32.820 --> 42:33.937
When Fei Ni gets married,

42:33.937 --> 42:35.160
don't forget our wedding candy.

42:35.210 --> 42:36.210
Married?

42:36.210 --> 42:37.050
To whom?

42:37.650 --> 42:38.260
Oh, please.

42:38.420 --> 42:39.530
Still denying it?

42:39.530 --> 42:40.940
The director's son the other day,

42:40.940 --> 42:42.570
and now the hero
who saved someone.

42:42.610 --> 42:44.260
Your daughter really is something.

42:45.090 --> 42:46.820
And this new son-in-law of yours

42:46.820 --> 42:47.820
is quite impressive.

42:47.940 --> 42:49.530
The gifts he brought you

42:49.610 --> 42:51.460
are top quality, no doubt.

42:51.460 --> 42:52.570
He's not my son-in-law.

42:53.570 --> 42:54.820
Stop pretending.

42:54.820 --> 42:56.420
My husband said

42:56.420 --> 42:57.570
he just saw them downstairs,

42:57.570 --> 43:00.010
holding hands.

43:07.940 --> 43:08.570
All right.

43:09.210 --> 43:10.130
Whose idea was it?

43:10.460 --> 43:11.260
- Mine.
- Mine.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
